Package: gravitypool
Type: Package
Title: Gravitational Recirculation and Energy Evaluation for Swimming Pools
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Ricardo", "Ochoa Sosa", email = "ricardo@gravitypool.io", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Hydrodynamic modeling, structural sizing, life cycle carbon
    assessment (LCA), and financial payback evaluation for gravitational
    and hybrid bypass pool recirculation systems versus traditional
    electrochemical battery storage and grid-tied pumping. Includes an
    interactive consultation Shiny application built with bslib.
